253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 178 0 R
/T (The roots of this parallel conflict run deep, stemming from the 1994 genocide against the Tutsi, the flight of its perpetrators into eastern Congo, and three decades of cross-border insurgency. The Background section provides a detailed account of this history and the diplomatic escalations of early 2025. What is significant here is that by January 2025, both sides of the conflict were conducting information campaigns alongside their military and diplomatic efforts. This report examines what transpired when those narratives were implemented on a large scale on platform X: who was involved, the mechanisms used, and the target audiences.)
/E (The roots of this parallel conflict run deep, stemming from the 1994 genocide against the Tutsi, the flight of its perpetrators into eastern Congo, and three decades of cross-border insurgency. The Background section provides a detailed account of this history and the diplomatic escalations of early 2025. What is significant here is that by January 2025, both sides of the conflict were conducting information campaigns alongside their military and diplomatic efforts. This report examines what transpired when those narratives were implemented on a large scale on platform X: who was involved, the mechanisms used, and the target audiences.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [0]
>>
