/T (The wars of the Kivus have never been a purely regional affair. Eastern Congo's mineral wealth has consistently drawn foreign commercial and security networks whose activity shaped the battlefield while remaining largely invisible to the publics and institutions deliberating over the conflict. The defeat of M23's first insurgency offers a documented example. Records released under the United States' Epstein Files Transparency Act, together with hacked correspondence of former Israeli Prime Minister Ehud Barak reported by Drop Site News in June 2026, show that the network of financier Jeffrey Epstein operated on both the military and commercial sides of the 2013 war. )
/E (The wars of the Kivus have never been a purely regional affair. Eastern Congo's mineral wealth has consistently drawn foreign commercial and security networks whose activity shaped the battlefield while remaining largely invisible to the publics and institutions deliberating over the conflict. The defeat of M23's first insurgency offers a documented example. Records released under the United States' Epstein Files Transparency Act, together with hacked correspondence of former Israeli Prime Minister Ehud Barak reported by Drop Site News in June 2026, show that the network of financier Jeffrey Epstein operated on both the military and commercial sides of the 2013 war. )
