/T (What this investigation documents is not that model. It is a campaign that understood, with some precision, that the relevant battlefield for this conflict had migrated. The operation analysed here did not seek mass persuasion. It targeted a narrow set of institutional decision-makers, operating in a digital environment with minimal friction, where a small number of coordinated accounts, basic scripting, and precise timing were sufficient to insert narratives directly into the communication channels of the UN, EU and the Security Council.)
