/T (The prevailing response to influence operations is to identify falsehoods and correct them. That approach is poorly suited to this case because the content in question is not wholly fabricated.)
/E (The prevailing response to influence operations is to identify falsehoods and correct them. That approach is poorly suited to this case because the content in question is not wholly fabricated.)
