/T (The appropriate response is not fact-checking in isolation, but context restoration. This is slower, more resource-intensive, and dependent on local knowledge that is currently underdeveloped in the Great Lakes information environment. Every attempt to counter this network's content by labelling it false will fail, because the content is not false in every particular. It is true facts assembled into a false picture. The only thing that works is restoring the stripped context, and the only people who can do that reliably are those close enough to the conflict to know what the context is.)
/E (The appropriate response is not fact-checking in isolation, but context restoration. This is slower, more resource-intensive, and dependent on local knowledge that is currently underdeveloped in the Great Lakes information environment. Every attempt to counter this network's content by labelling it false will fail, because the content is not false in every particular. It is true facts assembled into a false picture. The only thing that works is restoring the stripped context, and the only people who can do that reliably are those close enough to the conflict to know what the context is.)
/Pg 39 0 R
