/E (The asymmetry between the sophistication of the manipulation and the capacity of the defence is not incidental to this story. It is the story. European and North American FIMI frameworks, analyst networks, and rapid alert systems have no Great Lakes equivalent. The cost of that gap is paid in the quality of the international decisions the manipulation targets.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [4]
