1244 0 obj
<<
/Title (The UN Group of Experts documents FARDC cooperation with FDLR elements. Anti-Tutsi violence in the DRC is real. The FARDC did bomb Minembwe, and Banyamulenge civilians do live there. The network's work was not fabrication. It was re-voicing: taking documented facts, stripping their context, removing attribution, and reassembling them into a picture that served a particular conclusion. The Minembwe airfield was a military target held by an M23-aligned armed group. That one fact, removed, turns an airstrike into a genocide. The operation did not invent the strike. It erased the context around it and re-addressed the remainder to the UN and EU as the testimony of ordinary citizens.)
/Dest [38 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1236 0 R
/Prev 1243 0 R
>>
endobj
1245 0 obj
