1283 0 obj
<<
/Title (The operation's value to its sponsor, therefore, rests on two effects that engagement metrics do not capture: occupying the hashtag search surface, including the hijacked #CongolaisTelema, and placing content directly in front of the institutional accounts it tagged. An operation that places 181 genocide accusations in the mention feeds of @UN and @EUCouncil during a sanctions deliberation does not need a breakout to have done its job. It needs one staffer, one analyst, or one journalist to screenshot a post and ask, "Is there something to this?" in the wrong meeting.)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1276 0 R
/Prev 1287 0 R
>>
endobj
